## Product essence (do not violate)

- 4 companies, `companyId` isolation on every protected path.
- HUF 5 Ft rounding; `financialEffective` on money sums.
- OSIV off; new REST method needs `@PreAuthorize`; never widen `archunit_store/`.
- Platform rule: client → platform yes, **client → client never**.
- Renderer/Electron fixes reach offices only via a **signed installer**, not Hetzner.
- End users are not developers: no manual CLI deliverable.
- Tests are the contract: never weaken, skip, or rewrite a failing test to go green.

## Language

Machine artifacts, code, comments, commits: **English**.
User-facing report and UI copy: **Hungarian**.
